{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09703","headline":"送郭乂杂言 · 岑参","name":"送郭乂杂言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地上青草出，经冬今始归。\n博陵无近信，犹未换春衣。\n怜汝不忍别，送汝上酒楼。\n初行莫早发，且宿霸桥头。\n功名须及早，岁月莫虚掷。\n早年已工诗，近日兼注易。\n何时过东洛，早晚度盟津。\n朝歌城边柳嚲地，邯郸道上花扑人。\n去年四月初，我正在河朔。\n曾上君家县北楼，楼上分明见恒岳。\n中山明府待君来，须计行程及早回。\n到家速觅长安使，待汝书封我自开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09703.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09703","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}